  "details": "It is abit frustrating when you use controllers like the Index ones and you get stuck in place when you use the expression menu. \nEither allow specific controllers to be allowed to move while it is open or change it so when you have one menu open, set the second controller to have tank controls like when you only have one controller switched on. \nThis current setting is like a stepback from the old Vive controls where you couldn't even use your gestures on your left hand while moving compared to Vive advanced controls where we can move.",
